{"t": 1794120083.0472095, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"issue_key": "PAY-618", "body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout.promo.normalize_code`:\n\n```python\ndef normalize_code(code: str) -> str:\n    return \"\".join(code.split()).upper()\n```\n\nThis strips surrounding whitespace, removes inner spaces, and upper-cases the code before lookup.\n\nVerified locally: `' autumn24 '`, `'Autumn 24'`, `'  aut umn 24\\n'` and `'autumn24'` all normalise to `AUTUMN24`.\n\nAddresses Sentry issue CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q (`PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist`, ~2,940 events, os=Android 15, app=android 8.2)."}, "ok": true}
